    "description": {
      "value": "This tightly sealed metal container is filled with highly pressurized gas that can explode to release a powerful shockwave. A pressure bomb deals the listed bludgeoning damage and splash damage. On a critical hit, the target is knocked prone. Many types grant an item bonus to attack rolls, and more powerful pressure bombs can knock creatures back. You gain a +2 item bonus to attack rolls. The bomb deals 3d4 bludgeoning damage and 3 bludgeoning splash damage. Medium or smaller targets are pushed 5 feet away from you."
